-   Presentation-only enhancement. Existing export button ID,
-   workbook generation and permit/shipment data stay unchanged.
-   ========================================================== */
-
-.export-panel-v5,
-.export-panel-v7{
-  overflow:visible !important;
-  background:transparent !important;
-  border:0 !important;
-  box-shadow:none !important;
-}
-
